# Binary files -- NEVER let Git apply line-ending (CRLF/LF) conversion to
# these. On Windows, Git's core.autocrlf=true (a common default) silently
# rewrites \n -> \r\n in files it thinks are text, which corrupts binary
# formats like pickled models. This caused an "input stream corrupted"
# XGBoost error when loading deployed_model.pkl after a git checkout.
*.pkl -text
*.pyc -text
*.png -text
*.webp -text
*.zip -text
